        "MessageId": 101470211,
        "Flag": 2,
        "Type": 0,
        "NextId": 101460227,
        "MessageType": "Text",
        "ImagePath": "",
        "MessageJP": "それが一番よね",
        "MessageKR": "현명한 판단이겠지",
        "MessageTW": "才是明智的判斷吧",
        "MessageEN": "is distance yourself from things that threaten your safety."
